{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/baek5p","slide":1,"text":"00:00–00:12｜棋童是我为四到十岁国际象棋初学者制作的智能学习平台。我六岁开始学棋，发现真正让初学者放弃的，往往不是兴趣，而是听不懂专业术语，也看不到持续进步。\n\n[Sources]\n- 项目仓库 README.md、LLM_ENGINEERING_NOTES.md、源代码与本地页面。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/teoqqe","slide":2,"title":"WHY","textShapes":13}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dk3edwf6","slide":2,"text":"WHY","textPreview":"WHY","textChars":3,"textLines":1,"bbox":[64,42,520,24]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/qhsfi1gf","slide":2,"text":"问题不是不会下，而是听不懂、难坚持","textPreview":"问题不是不会下，而是听不懂、难坚持","textChars":17,"textLines":1,"bbox":[64,78,1150,66]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/bilwb6x0","slide":2,"text":"学生","textPreview":"学生","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[70,238,180,32]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0nuxobyh","slide":2,"text":"“为什么这步错了？”","textPreview":"“为什么这步错了？”","textChars":10,"textLines":1,"bbox":[70,286,300,42]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lo3ehgf2","slide":2,"text":"传统题库只告诉对错，缺少学生能理解的解释。","textPreview":"传统题库只告诉对错，缺少学生能理解的解释。","textChars":21,"textLines":1,"bbox":[70,345,330,80]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ylcfm1gr","slide":2,"text":"家长","textPreview":"家长","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[470,238,180,32]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zmlwf6xc","slide":2,"text":"“我不会棋，怎么陪？”","textPreview":"“我不会棋，怎么陪？”","textChars":11,"textLines":1,"bbox":[470,286,330,42]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8bexsvyt","slide":2,"text":"通过进度、周报和建议，家长不懂棋也能参与。","textPreview":"通过进度、周报和建议，家长不懂棋也能参与。","textChars":21,"textLines":1,"bbox":[470,345,320,80]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9cnylgfe","slide":2,"text":"老师","textPreview":"老师","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[870,238,180,32]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dkfupsr2","slide":2,"text":"“课后练习如何追踪？”","textPreview":"“课后练习如何追踪？”","textChars":11,"textLines":1,"bbox":[870,286,330,42]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/szmdw7ah","slide":2,"text":"作业、班级与学习数据形成可追踪的闭环。","textPreview":"作业、班级与学习数据形成可追踪的闭环。","textChars":19,"textLines":1,"bbox":[870,345,310,80]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/rydcn29w","slide":2,"bbox":[64,506,1152,90]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/qx4vuxsb","slide":2,"text":"我的设计原则：反馈清楚、数据可追踪、关键依赖失效时系统仍然可用。","textPreview":"我的设计原则：反馈清楚、数据可追踪、关键依赖失效时系统仍然可用。","textChars":32,"textLines":1,"bbox":[98,532,1080,38]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/1ofutcry","slide":2,"text":"02","textPreview":"02","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1190,674,36,20]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/teoqqe","slide":2,"text":"00:12–00:27｜我把问题拆成三个角色：学生需要即时反馈；家长需要可读的学习数据；老师需要课后任务和班级追踪。我的设计原则，是让反馈清楚、让数据可追踪，并让系统在关键依赖不可用时仍然可用。\n\n[Sources]\n- 项目仓库 README.md、LLM_ENGINEERING_NOTES.md、源代码与本地页面。"}
